=== str-tclc-after-subst
from: Air 0.1.32 lib/Air/Form.rakumod:369
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method tclc
--- code
for 'first-name', 'E-MAIL-address' -> $name {
    my $label;
    my $display = $label ?? $label !! $name.subst('-', ' ', :g).tclc;
    say $display;
}
--- expect
First name
E mail address

=== str-tclc-method-call-interpolation
from: HTTP::HPACK 1.0.3 lib/HTTP/HPACK.rakumod:145
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method tclc
--- code
my class X::Overflow is Exception {
    has $.what;
    has $.offset;
    method message() { "$!what.tclc() at byte $!offset overflows input buffer" }
}
say X::Overflow.new(what => 'INTEGER', offset => 7).message;
--- expect
Integer at byte 7 overflows input buffer

