=== str-fc-eq-both
from: MUGS::Games 0.1.4 lib/MUGS/Server/Game/Adventure.rakumod:38
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method fc
--- code
my class Thing { has $.name }
my @known = Thing.new(name => 'Lamp'), Thing.new(name => 'STRASSE');
for 'lamp', 'straße' -> $name {
    say @known.first(*.name.fc eq $name.fc).?name // 'nothing';
}
--- expect
Lamp
STRASSE

