26

=== str-trim-trailing-heredoc
from: MUGS::Core 0.1.4 lib/MUGS/App/DevTool.rakumod:166
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method trim-trailing
--- code
my $help = 'Usage: devtool [options]' ~ "\n"
         ~ q:to/OPTIONS/.trim-trailing;
              --verbose   say more
              --quiet     say less

            OPTIONS
say $help;
say '---';
--- expect
Usage: devtool [options]
  --verbose   say more
  --quiet     say less
---

